{"title":"중간 보스의 소꿉친구가 되었다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=iPnKB/hAFrTdBPTn/9obm00qXh6ZNGikKsLOVQK&filename=th3","synopsis":"토끼 한 마리도 잡지 못하는 가문의 수치. 신검 도가의 래빗, 도견우.\n5학년 개학 첫 날, 전학생을 보고 전생을 떠올린다.\n\n환생한 이 곳은 전생의 게임 [브레이브 하츠] 세계.\n찌질이 캐릭터로 환생 한 것도 억울한데, 전학생이 무려\n세상을 멸망 시킬 중간 보스라니!\n\n“왜 이렇게 나한테 잘해 주는 거야?”\n“너랑 친해지고 싶어서.”\n\n너와 친구가 되어서 세상의 멸망을 막겠어!\n\n이 세상에서 살아남기 위해. 원하는 엔딩에 도달하기 위해.\n나는, 중간 보스의 소꿉친구가 되었다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":264,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":272,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":288,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":284,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":269,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":256,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":295,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":267,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":269,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":217,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":257,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":249,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":263,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":223,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":259,"change":{"type":"down","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":275,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":261,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":278,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":288,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null